{'symbol': 'QRVO', 'date': '2022-11-02 16:30:00', 'title': 'QORVO® AND SK SILTRON CSS ANNOUNCE LONG-TERM SILICON CARBIDE (SIC) SUPPLY AGREEMENT', 'text': 'GREENSBORO, N.C. AND AUBURN, MICH., NOV. 02, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- QORVO® (NASDAQ: QRVO), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF CONNECTIVITY AND POWER SOLUTIONS, AND SK SILTRON CSS, A SEMICONDUCTOR WAFER MANUFACTURER, ANNOUNCED TODAY THEY HAVE FINALIZED A MULTI-YEAR SUPPLY AGREEMENT FOR SILICON CARBIDE (SIC) BARE AND EPITAXIAL WAFERS.'}